5587-8887-4e03-89d7-e7c1dd87a1e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e114d5610da647bc10ba45fc0005fefd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、いつもお世話になっております。\n自創作キャラの【怪盗エクレメス】を玖条さんにを描いて頂きたく、お願いに参りました…！\n\n▼デザイン参考\nhttps://twitter.com/Guri_nautilus/status/1492496906060451842?s=20&t=ItFW2qjGHxhMNg5wnOSHwQ\nシチュエーション、ポーズ等は全てお任せします。\n\nご都合悪ければこのリクエストは流して構いません！\n何卒宜しくお願い致します。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@infinitekujo/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fdb5d465/uploads/origins/404b1059-e7a9-4b7d-8fa2-da68911d2fb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=178bc3d5703e4ed4592eb414fb3165aa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fdb5d465/uploads/origins/404b1059-e7a9-4b7d-8fa2-da68911d2fb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=178bc3d5703e4ed4592eb414fb3165aa, https://si.imgix.net/fdb5d465/uploads/origins/404b1059-e7a9-4b7d-8fa2-da68911d2fb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7c236c8902c47403d254eb954a749692 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fdb5d465/uploads/origins/404b1059-e7a9-4b7d-8fa2-da68911d2fb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ee7433a8329f4260474f5c319feb3bce 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@infinitekujo/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c7de5404/uploads/origins/7b05b025-8c67-4523-96f8-1f1b12134364?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6918cfb741e2c6f